# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 217
msgid ""
"If your GPU supports video encoding, conversion will be much faster.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic detection is usually the best choice, but you can also select it manually.\n"
"\n"
"Software mode is slower but compatible with more formats.\n"
"\n"
"If the GPU isn’t supported, the system will try partial GPU processing and automatically fall back to Software mode if needed."
msgstr ""
"Ako vaša GPU podržava video kodiranje, konverzija će biti mnogo brža.\n"
"\n"
"Automatsko otkrivanje obično je najbolji izbor, ali ga možete odabrati i ručno.\n"
"\n"
"Softverski način rada je sporiji, ali kompatibilan s više formata.\n"
"\n"
"Ako GPU nije podržan, sustav će pokušati djelomično GPU procesiranje i automatski se prebaciti na softverski način rada ako bude potrebno."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 223
msgid ""
"Higher quality means a larger file.\n"
"\n"
"The default option is a good balance between image quality and file size."
msgstr ""
"Veća kvaliteta znači veća datoteka.\n"
"\n"
"Zadana opcija je dobar balans između kvalitete slike i veličine datoteke."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 232
msgid ""
"H.264: An older format that works on almost all devices. It takes up more storage space but is the fastest to convert.\n"
"\n"
"H.265: A newer version of H.264. It doesn't work on older devices and compresses files more efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"VP9: Widely used by YouTube. If your computer doesn't have a compatible graphics card, the conversion can be very slow.\n"
"\n"
"AV1: The most modern format. It offers the best compression (creating smaller files), but the conversion can also be slow if the graphics card isn't compatible.\n"
"\n"
"ProRes: Professional editing codec (Apple). Preserves maximum quality for video editing workflows. CPU-only, outputs .mov format."
msgstr ""
"H.264: Stariji format koji radi na gotovo svim uređajima. Zauzima više prostora za pohranu, ali je najbrži za konverziju.\n"
"\n"
"H.265: Novija verzija H.264. Ne radi na starijim uređajima i komprimira datoteke učinkovitije.\n"
"\n"
"VP9: Široko korišten od strane YouTube-a. Ako vaš računalni sustav nema kompatibilnu grafičku karticu, konverzija može biti vrlo spora.\n"
"\n"
"AV1: Najmoderniji format. Nudi najbolju kompresiju (stvarajući manje datoteke), ali konverzija također može biti spora ako grafička kartica nije kompatibilna.\n"
"\n"
"ProRes: Profesionalni codec za uređivanje (Apple). Održava maksimalnu kvalitetu za radne tokove uređivanja videa. Samo CPU, izlazi u .mov formatu."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 230
msgid ""
"Copy is usually best, fast and preserves full quality.\n"
"\n"
"Re-encoding slightly reduces quality but improves compatibility and can reduce file size."
msgstr ""
"Kopiranje je obično najbolje, brzo i očuva punu kvalitetu.\n"
"\n"
"Ponovno kodiranje malo smanjuje kvalitetu, ali poboljšava kompatibilnost i može smanjiti veličinu datoteke."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 234
msgid ""
"If subtitles are embedded, keeping them is usually best.\n"
"\n"
"Some players need an external subtitle file."
msgstr ""
"Ako su titlovi ugrađeni, obično je najbolje zadržati ih.\n"
"\n"
"Neki playeri trebaju vanjsku datoteku s titlovima."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 238
msgid ""
"Copying video is extremely fast and keeps full image quality.\n"
"\n"
"Perfect for cutting or trimming videos for social media."
msgstr ""
"Kopiranje videa je izuzetno brzo i zadržava punu kvalitetu slike.\n"
"\n"
"Savršeno za rezanje ili skraćivanje videa za društvene mreže."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 243
msgid ""
"Slower conversion produces smaller files.\n"
"\n"
"Faster presets create larger files but convert in less time."
msgstr ""
"Sporija konverzija proizvodi manje datoteke.\n"
"\n"
"Brži postavke stvaraju veće datoteke, ali se konvertiraju u kraćem vremenu."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 247
msgid ""
"Audio format (when converting):\n"
"\n"
"• AAC: Most compatible, good quality\n"
"• Opus: Excellent quality at small sizes\n"
"• AC3 (Dolby Digital): Good for home theater"
msgstr ""
"Audio format (prilikom konverzije):\n"
"\n"
"• AAC: Najkompatibilniji, dobra kvaliteta\n"
"• Opus: Izvrsna kvaliteta pri malim veličinama\n"
"• AC3 (Dolby Digital): Dobar za kućno kino"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 253
msgid ""
"Output size:\n"
"\n"
"• Original: Keep the same resolution\n"
"• Standard: 4K, Full HD, HD (TVs and monitors)\n"
"• Vertical: For phones and social media\n"
"• Custom: Set your own dimensions"
msgstr ""
"Veličina izlaza:\n"
"\n"
"• Izvorna: Zadržite istu rezoluciju\n"
"• Standardna: 4K, Full HD, HD (TV-i i monitore)\n"
"• Vertikalna: Za telefone i društvene mreže\n"
"• Prilagođena: Postavite vlastite dimenzije"

msgid ""
"Frames per second of the converted video:\n"
"\n"
"• Fewer frames: a smaller file. Measured with the same quality: 30 to 24 fps saved 10–17%, 30 to 15 fps saved 28–42%\n"
"• More frames: in-between frames are blended from their neighbours, so motion looks smoother but fast movement leaves a faint trail"
msgstr ""

msgid "Removes grain and the speckles of low-light video. Stronger levels also soften fine detail. Cleaner video compresses into a slightly smaller file."
msgstr ""

msgid "Makes edges and fine detail crisper (AMD contrast adaptive sharpening). Sharper video makes a slightly larger file."
msgstr ""

msgid "Steadies shaky camera footage. The video is analysed first, so the conversion takes about twice as long; the edges are zoomed in slightly to hide the movement."
msgstr ""

msgid "How the colours of this video are coded. Keep the file's own description unless the preview looks grey and washed out: then the file is HDR without saying so, usually HDR10 (PQ), or HLG for some broadcasts. The conversion reads it the same way."
msgstr ""

msgid "Applies a colour look from a LUT file (.cube, .3dl) or an mpv shader (.hook, .glsl) to the whole video."
msgstr ""

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 265
msgid ""
"• MP4: Most compatible\n"
"• MKV: More features\n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes workflows\n"
"• WebM: Web optimized (VP9/AV1)"
msgstr ""
"• MP4: Najveća kompatibilnost\n"
"• MKV: Više značajki\n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes radni tokovi\n"
"• WebM: Optimizirano za web (VP9/AV1)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 262
msgid ""
"• Move right: Brighter\n"
"• Move left: Darker\n"
"• Default: 0 (no change)"
msgstr ""
"• Pomakni desno: Svjetlije\n"
"• Pomakni lijevo: Tamnije\n"
"• Zadano: 0 (bez promjene)"

msgid ""
"• Move right: More vivid\n"
"• Move left: More muted\n"
"• Default: 0% (no change)"
msgstr ""

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 270
msgid ""
"• Positive: More red/yellow\n"
"• Negative: More blue/green\n"
"• Default: 0 (no change)"
msgstr ""
"• Pozitivno: Više crvene/žute\n"
"• Negativno: Više plave/zelene\n"
"• Zadano: 0 (bez promjene)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 255
msgid "Crop the video's edges to keep only the part you need."
msgstr "Isecite rubove videozapisa kako biste zadržali samo dio koji vam je potreban."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 276
msgid ""
"Select parts of the video to keep.\n"
"\n"
"Add sections with the + button or directly in the video using the markers button above the video.\n"
"\n"
"You can export selected parts as one file or as multiple clips\n"
" ideal for creating short videos for social media."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite dijelove videa koje želite zadržati.\n"
"\n"
"Dodajte odjeljke pomoću + gumba ili izravno u videu koristeći gumb oznaka iznad videa.\n"
"\n"
"Možete izvesti odabrane dijelove kao jednu datoteku ili kao više isječaka, idealno za stvaranje kratkih videa za društvene mreže."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 282
msgid ""
"Run decode on the CPU and encode on the GPU.\n"
"\n"
"Usually best left disabled, but can help with certain compatibility issues."
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite dekodiranje na CPU-u i kodiranje na GPU-u.\n"
"\n"
"Obično je najbolje ostaviti onemogućeno, ali može pomoći s određenim problemima kompatibilnosti."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 286
msgid ""
"Audio quality:\n"
"\n"
"• Higher = better quality, larger file\n"
"• 128k: Good for most content\n"
"• 192k: High quality\n"
"• 256k+: Professional use\n"
"• Default: Auto (encoder decides)"
msgstr ""
"Kvaliteta zvuka:\n"
"\n"
"• Više = bolja kvaliteta, veća datoteka\n"
"• 128k: Dobar za većinu sadržaja\n"
"• 192k: Visoka kvaliteta\n"
"• 256k+: Profesionalna upotreba\n"
"• Zadano: Automatski (enkoder odlučuje)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 294
msgid ""
"Number of audio channels:\n"
"\n"
"• 1: Mono (single speaker)\n"
"• 2: Stereo (left/right)\n"
"• 6: 5.1 Surround\n"
"• 8: 7.1 Surround\n"
"• Default: Keep original"
msgstr ""
"Broj audio kanala:\n"
"\n"
"• 1: Mono (jedan zvučnik)\n"
"• 2: Stereo (lijevo/desno)\n"
"• 6: 5.1 Surround\n"
"• 8: 7.1 Surround\n"
"• Zadano: Zadrži izvorno"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 302
msgid ""
"Advanced: Custom FFmpeg options.\n"
"\n"
"• For experienced users only\n"
"• Invalid options may cause errors\n"
"• Example: -ss 60 -t 30 (skip 60s, take 30s)"
msgstr ""
"Napredno: Prilagođene FFmpeg opcije.\n"
"\n"
"• Samo za iskusne korisnike\n"
"• Nevažeće opcije mogu uzrokovati greške\n"
"• Primjer: -ss 60 -t 30 (preskoči 60s, uzmi 30s)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 273
msgid "Skips all remaining processes and just exports the embedded subtitles as an SRT file."
msgstr "Preskoči sve preostale procese i jednostavno izvozi ugrađene titlove kao SRT datoteku."

msgid ""
"Reduces background noise from speech with a neural network.\n"
"\n"
"• Requires audio re-encoding\n"
"• Works best for constant background noise\n"
"• Automatically re-encodes audio if set to copy"
msgstr ""
"Smanjuje pozadinsku buku iz govora pomoću neuronske mreže.\n"
"\n"
"• Potrebno ponovno kodiranje zvuka\n"
"• Najbolje radi za konstantnu pozadinsku buku\n"
"• Automatski ponovno kodira zvuk ako je postavljeno na kopiranje"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 327
msgid ""
"Adjust the intensity of noise reduction\n"
"\n"
"• 1.0: Maximum reduction (default)\n"
"• 0.5: Moderate reduction\n"
"• Lower values preserve more original audio"
